guide forever/class/warlock/orb-of-noh-orahil
title The Orb of Noh'Orahil
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 38-40
zone The Barrens
keywords Shard of an Infernal, Acolyte Magaz, Infus Emerald, Imprisoned Infernal Spirit, Lesser Infernal, Fragments of the Orb of Orahil, Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil, Tabetha, Orb of Noh'Orahil, Staff of Noh'Orahil, Warlock, class weapon
pitch Acolyte Magaz's path: an infernal's spirit, for the Orb or Staff of Noh'Orahil.
pro Ends with your choice of an off-hand orb or a staff

# The infernal path of the Orb of Orahil (after forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil):
# Shard of an Infernal (4963) from Acolyte Magaz, the Infernal Orb for
# Fragments of the Orb of Orahil (1799), Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961)
# and Returning the Cleansed Orb (4976) with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh, and
# The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil (4975) from Menara Voidrender.
# Shard of an Infernal and Shard of a Felhound (4962,
# forever/class/warlock/orb-of-dar-orahil) exclude each other.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; Wowhead's Classic quest
# pages (wowhead.com/classic/quest=4963, =4964) for using the Infus Emerald on
# an infernal and for waiting while Menara finishes the orb; Wowhead Forever's
# Warlock class page (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json):
# unchanged in Forever.
# The Demon of the Orb (4961) is elite.
# Lint warns that Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961) needs Shard of a
# Felhound (4962): quests.json (preAll, from pfQuest and Questie-Forever)
# lists both 1799 and 4962 before it, though 4962 and 4963 exclude each
# other. Whether this path still reaches Tabetha in Forever is unconfirmed
# until launch; the warning is kept, not hidden.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step Acolyte Magaz
  zone The Barrens
  tip Acolyte Magaz stands beside Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet. He gives you the Infus Emerald.
  accept 4963                         -- Acolyte Magaz

step Mannoroc Coven
  zone Desolace
  tip The demons of Mannoroc Coven, in southern Desolace, have both. Burning Blade Summoners carry the Infernal Orb. Use the Infus Emerald on a Lesser Infernal and kill it for its spirit.
  collect 7291 quest 1799.1           -- Infernal Orb, from the Burning Blade Summoners
  collect 12649 quest 4963.1          -- Imprisoned Infernal Spirit, from a Lesser Infernal

step The infernal's spirit
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet with the spirit first: Tabetha's cleansing follows it.
  turnin 4963                         -- Menara Voidrender

step Tabetha
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Tabetha lives at her farm in western Dustwallow Marsh. She calls the Demon of the Orb out of the Infernal Orb; it is elite: grouping up is advised.
  turnin 1799                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4961
  kill 6549 quest 4961.1              -- Demon of the Orb
  turnin 4961                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4976

step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara in the tower above Ratchet with the cleansed orb. Wait while she completes the Orb of Noh'Orahil, then speak to her again.
  turnin 4976                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4975
  complete 4975                       -- Wait for the orb
  turnin 4975 choose 15107 15105      -- Menara Voidrender
